[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你醒来的时候，一只鞋里还盛着水。甲板在脸颊下面晃，铁锈刮得皮肤发疼。有人正把一条湿透的绳子从你胸口抽出来，动作很慢，怕碰断了什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="能听见吗？别急着坐。你刚才吐了好多水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="……我的船呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我们没看见船。只有一块门板，还有你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把你的手放到栏杆上。手指会握紧，也知道怎样随着船身起伏卸力。身体似乎来过这里，可你叫不出海的名字，更叫不出自己的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿，毯子给他。帕金斯，后面那道烟还跟着吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="跟着。一直在我们出水的位置转圈。它不像在搜残骸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我是不是……给你们惹麻烦了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="麻烦从昨晚就跟着了。你只赶上了后半场。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她想笑一下，嘴唇却被冻得发白。你看见她虎口一道新口子，血被盐水冲成了淡粉色。她注意到你的目光，把手缩进袖口。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我是弗莱彻。我们是第五驱逐小队。先记住这个，想不起别的也没关系。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="第五……还有别的人吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="有。莫里在前面探路，拉姆森拖着我们的补给艇。现在加上你，都要回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="队长，主航道封了。灯号喊三遍，没一盏回。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="那句话让甲板上突然安静。德雷顿替你掖住毯子的手也停了一瞬。远处传来两声低响，听上去不像雷；第二声之后，她们一起看向海面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你们救我的时候……我说过什么吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="说了。你一直让我别回头。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你回头了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不然怎么把你拉上来。好啦，别替刚认识的人担心。先告诉我，你还记得什么？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

